#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:6
msgid "Datro repo autosync + PR automation (reboot-safe)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:8
msgid "When to use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:10
msgid ""
"Use this any time you need the `datro` repo on `command.financecheque.uk`"
" to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:11
msgid "Automatically pull/rebase when GitHub `unclehowell/datro` moves ahead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:12
msgid ""
"Automatically create/update a PR when the server’s work branch is ahead, "
"so a human can merge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:14
msgid ""
"This is a **server feature** implemented with systemd (not dependent on "
"an LLM being online)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:16
msgid "Design (policy)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"Upstream canonical branch is **origin/HEAD** (typically `gh-pages` for "
"this repo)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:19
msgid "Local work happens on a stable branch (default `auto-sync-ui`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:20
msgid "If GitHub is ahead: the server rebases the work branch onto upstream."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"If the server is ahead: the server runs `./pr_automation.sh` to "
"create/update a PR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:22
msgid "The system stores the latest PR URL on disk for notification/inspection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:24
msgid "Prereqs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:26
msgid "Repo exists and remote is configured:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:27
msgid "`/home/ubuntu/datro` is a git clone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:28
msgid "`origin` points to `https://github.com/unclehowell/datro.git`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:30
msgid "GitHub CLI installed + authenticated (non-interactive):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:31
msgid "`gh auth status` must be OK for user `ubuntu`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:33
msgid "Permissions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:34
msgid "`ubuntu` must be able to write:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:35
#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:85
msgid "`/var/log/datro-auto-sync.log`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:36
msgid "`/var/lib/datro-auto-sync/`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:38
msgid "Implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:40
msgid "A) Script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:42
#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:68
msgid "Create:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:43
msgid "`/home/ubuntu/datro/scripts/auto-sync.sh`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:45
msgid "Responsibilities:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:46
msgid "Detect upstream branch:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`UPSTREAM_BRANCH=$(git remote show origin | awk -F': ' '/HEAD branch/ "
"{print $2; exit}')`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:48
msgid "fallback to `gh-pages`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:49
msgid "Checkout work branch (default `auto-sync-ui`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:50
msgid "`git fetch origin --prune`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:51
msgid "`git pull --rebase --autostash origin \"$UPSTREAM_BRANCH\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:52
msgid "`git add -A` then commit if staged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:53
msgid "Compute ahead/behind vs `origin/$UPSTREAM_BRANCH` using:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:54
msgid "`git rev-list --left-right --count \"origin/$UPSTREAM_BRANCH...HEAD\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:55
msgid "If ahead > 0:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:56
msgid ""
"run repo PR script **in UPDATE mode** so PR head contains the actual "
"commits:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:57
msgid ""
"`DEFAULT_BASE_BRANCH=\"$UPSTREAM_BRANCH\" bash ./pr_automation.sh "
"<<<\"2\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:58
msgid "extract PR URL from output and write it to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:59
#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:88
msgid "`/var/lib/datro-auto-sync/pr_latest_url.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:61
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Avoid feeding `pr_automation.sh` via a pipeline (`printf ... |"
" ...`) inside systemd. That caused intermittent `exit status 141` "
"(SIGPIPE). Use a here-string / heredoc:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:63
msgid "good: `./pr_automation.sh <<<\"2\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:64
msgid "bad:  `printf \"2\\n\" | ./pr_automation.sh`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:66
msgid "B) systemd unit + timer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:69
msgid ""
"`/etc/systemd/system/datro-auto-sync.service` (Type=oneshot, User=ubuntu,"
" WorkingDirectory=/home/ubuntu/datro)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:70
msgid ""
"`/etc/systemd/system/datro-auto-sync.timer` (every 5 minutes, "
"Persistent=true)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:72
msgid "Recommended hardening in service:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:73
msgid "`NoNewPrivileges=true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:74
msgid "`PrivateTmp=true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:75
msgid "`ProtectSystem=full`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:76
msgid ""
"`ReadWritePaths=/home/ubuntu/datro /var/log/datro-auto-sync.log /var/lib"
"/datro-auto-sync /tmp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:78
msgid "Enable:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:79
msgid "`systemctl daemon-reload`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:80
msgid "`systemctl enable --now datro-auto-sync.timer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:82
msgid "Storage locations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:84
msgid "Log:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:86
msgid "State:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:87
msgid "`/var/lib/datro-auto-sync/pr_last_output.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:89
msgid "`/var/lib/datro-auto-sync/last_pr_epoch`  (PR throttle timestamp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:91
msgid "Verification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:93
msgid "Timer enabled:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:94
msgid "`systemctl status datro-auto-sync.timer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:96
msgid "Service runs clean:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:97
msgid "`systemctl start datro-auto-sync.service`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:98
msgid "`systemctl status datro-auto-sync.service`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:100
msgid "PR URL produced (when ahead):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:101
msgid "`cat /var/lib/datro-auto-sync/pr_latest_url.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:103
msgid "Log sanity:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:104
msgid "`tail -n 200 /var/log/datro-auto-sync.log`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:106
msgid "Common pitfalls (what we learned)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:108
msgid "Duplicate sync mechanisms causing PR spam"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:109
msgid ""
"This machine may already have cron-based sync jobs (e.g. `~/.hermes/repo-"
"sync.sh` via `repo-sync-cron.sh`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:110
msgid ""
"If `datro-auto-sync.timer` is enabled, disable those cron jobs to enforce"
" a single policy and keep PR creation under control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:111
msgid "`crontab -l` then comment out any `repo-sync-cron.sh` lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:113
msgid "State dir permission errors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:114
msgid ""
"Symptom: `Permission denied` writing `/var/lib/datro-auto-"
"sync/pr_last_output.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:115
#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:124
msgid "Fix:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:116
msgid "`sudo chown -R ubuntu:ubuntu /var/lib/datro-auto-sync`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:117
msgid "`sudo chmod 750 /var/lib/datro-auto-sync`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:119
msgid "systemd exit 141 (SIGPIPE)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:120
msgid "Symptom: `status=141` with no other error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:121
msgid "Causes we hit in the wild:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:122
msgid "feeding interactive scripts via pipes under systemd"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:123
msgid "masking failures with `trap PIPE` (can make diagnosis harder)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:125
msgid "Prefer here-string/heredoc input (bash) instead of pipelines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:126
msgid ""
"Avoid `trap PIPE` in this oneshot; make sure the script ends with `exit "
"0` on success."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:127
msgid ""
"If you see `syntax error near unexpected token '<<<'`, you likely have a "
"broken script (merge-conflict markers) or it’s being executed by `sh` "
"instead of `bash`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:129
msgid "PR created from the wrong branch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:130
msgid ""
"If you choose PR script option 1 (create new branch), it will root a "
"fresh `feature/auto-*` branch at origin and may leave your local commits "
"behind (you’ll see “you are leaving X commits behind”)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:131
msgid ""
"For autosync PRs, use option 2 (update/create PR for the current branch) "
"so the PR head contains the actual work-branch commits."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:133
msgid "PR rate limit (no more than 1 PR per 10 minutes)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:134
msgid "Implement a simple throttle in `auto-sync.sh` using an epoch file:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:135
msgid "write/read `/var/lib/datro-auto-sync/last_pr_epoch`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:136
msgid "skip running `pr_automation.sh` if `(now - last) < 600`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:137
msgid ""
"This prevents PR storms if the timer fires frequently or the repo remains"
" ahead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:139
msgid "systemd exit 141 (SIGPIPE) even when script works in a shell"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:140
msgid ""
"Cause: feeding `pr_automation.sh` via a pipeline inside a oneshot unit "
"can trigger SIGPIPE and make systemd report status=141."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:141
msgid ""
"Fix: do not use `printf ... | ./pr_automation.sh`. Use a here-string or "
"heredoc:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:143
msgid "`./pr_automation.sh <<<\"2\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:145
msgid "Optional: notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:147
msgid ""
"If you later wire notifications (Telegram, email, etc.), have the "
"notifier send the contents of:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:148
msgid "`/var/lib/datro-auto-sync/pr_latest_url.txt` whenever it changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-repo-autosync-pr_SKILL.md:151
msgid "Do NOT store API keys in this skill."
msgstr ""

